From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: identify Adreno 732 and accept its fuse-id wildcard

The inspected Uke GPU reports 0x43030b00. Keep Mesa's existing exact-chip
three-CCU profile; correct its name and accept the kernel's fuse-id encoding.
No GPU properties or neighboring device identities are changed.

---
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -1204,7 +1204,8 @@
 
 add_gpus([
         GPUId(chip_id=0xffff43030c00, name="Adreno X1-45"),
-        GPUId(chip_id=0xffff43030B00, name="FD735"),
+        GPUId(chip_id=0x43030b00, name="FD732"),
+        GPUId(chip_id=0xffff43030b00, name="FD732"),
         GPUId(chip_id=0xffff43030E01, name="Adreno (TM) 735"),
     ], A6xxGPUInfo(
         CHIP.A7XX,
